@prefix autofde: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/autofde/ontology#> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .


# Generator metamodel
#################################################################

autofde:GenerationRule a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:SPARQLQuery a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:TeraTemplate a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:GeneratedProjection a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:GenerationReceipt a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Receipt .
autofde:DriftRefusal a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Refusal .
autofde:ProjectionOwnership a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept .

#################################################################
